---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro';import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
const faq=[{q:'Does registration activate my screens?',a:'No. This is an expression of interest. Screen compatibility, location suitability, network readiness and commercial terms must be assessed before any onboarding.'},{q:'Is advertising income guaranteed?',a:'No. Acceptance, campaign allocation and revenue depend on advertiser demand, screen suitability, agreed terms and operational requirements.'},{q:'Who sells campaigns and how is revenue shared?',a:'Campaign sales responsibilities, reporting, deductions, revenue sharing and settlement timing must be specified in a VBN agreement. No commercial model has been confirmed for publication here.'},{q:'Can advertisers enquire here?',a:'Yes. Use the contact page and select VBN advertising opportunity. The enquiry can then be assessed for routing to the appropriate VBN contact once lead handling is configured.'}];
---
<Layout title="VBN advertising network — explore screen opportunities" description="Explore potential vending screen advertising participation through Vendvision Brand Network. Register interest for eligibility and readiness assessment; no guaranteed revenue."><section class="page-hero vbn-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">VENDVISION BRAND NETWORK / VBN</p><h1>Your screens.<br/>New media possibilities.</h1><p>Explore how eligible vending screens could participate in a regional advertising network, subject to compatibility, network readiness and agreed commercial terms.</p><a class="btn" href="#partner-form">Register Partner Interest ↗</a><p class="small-note">Expression of interest only. Production integration availability has not been confirmed.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Software connects.<br/>The network creates opportunity.</h2><p>VendBI is the software platform. VBN is the distinct advertising network. Vendvision is the wider vending solutions business. Software use does not automatically enrol a machine in advertising campaigns.</p></div><div class="steps">{[['01','Connect the context','Tell us about your machines, locations, connectivity and screen setup.'],['02','Qualify the fit','Screen hardware, site suitability and integration readiness need review.'],['03','Agree participation','Onboarding, responsibilities and commercial terms must be agreed before activation.'],['04','Campaigns & reporting','Campaign availability, reporting and settlement follow demand and agreed processes.']].map(([n,t,d])=><article><span>{n}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>)}</div></div></section><section class="section soft-bg"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU APPLY</p><h2>What makes<br/>a potential fit?</h2></div><div><ul class="check-list"><li>Screen-enabled machines with known hardware specifications</li><li>Suitable connectivity and operating conditions</li><li>Locations with appropriate site permissions</li><li>Willingness to meet content and operational requirements</li></ul><p>Supported screen sizes, protocols, geographies and availability are still to be confirmed. No published eligibility matrix or revenue estimate should be inferred.</p><a class="text-link" href="/resources/vending-screen-advertising-guide/">Read the operator’s preparation guide ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="section" id="partner-form"><div class="container form-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A NEW CONVERSATION FOR YOUR SCREENS</p><h2>Let’s explore<br/>the potential.</h2><p>Have screen-enabled machines? Share your setup for a future eligibility discussion.</p><div class="info-note"><h3>Planning, not a promise.</h3><p>Registration does not guarantee network acceptance, technical integration, campaign bookings or earnings.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Advertising or media enquiry? ↗</a></div><LeadForm kind="vbn"/></div></section><section class="section soft-bg"><div class="container faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE DETAILS MATTER</p><h2>Network questions.</h2></div><FAQ items={faq}/></div></section></Layout>
